menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_COMPANIONSHIP
    bool "Enable local companionship encouragement"
    default y
    help
        Provides a local, bounded encouragement reply keyed to a child's
        emotion so the device stays kind and responsive when the AI reply is
        unavailable. It pairs with the growth record and habit reminder caches
        to complete the offline companionship loop.

endmenu
